shunt (2.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Renamed from xray-gateway to Shunt. The old name promoted one replaceable
    component -- xray-core sits beside sing-box, dnsmasq and several egress
    providers -- into the name of the whole product.
  * The install path moves from /opt/xray-proxy to /opt/shunt and the units
    from xray-* to shunt-*, so this is a breaking change. Installing over an
    xray-gateway installation migrates the configuration, database and logs and
    retires the old units; the old code is left in place to be deleted by hand.
  * xray's own names are deliberately untouched: the binary, xray.json,
    XRAY_LOCATION_ASSET and the XRAY_* firewall chains all name the component,
    not the product.

